From 39a4effe8aec13f2131658ad976b16aef9e7f01d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bedasrv <266547973+bedasrv@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 17:55:26 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] plugins: add onRoute hook (pre-resolution model list ->
 ephemeral priority combo)

- onRoute plugin hook runs before combo/auto resolution; a plugin may return an ordered
  list of explicit model ids, served as an in-memory priority combo (maxRetries 0).
- API-key blockedModels always wins over the plugin's list.
- loader: fail fast when the plugin child is dead (no 10 s stall per request); onRoute uses a
  shorter timeout (OMNIROUTE_PLUGIN_ONROUTE_TIMEOUT_MS, default 5000).
- tests: plugins-onroute.test.ts; BUILTIN_EVENTS pin updated.
